 r"I am writing to apply for the Associate Consultant role on Konrad's Strategy team in London. I completed an MSc in Health Data Science at University College London in September 2026, where a distinction is expected, after a BSc in Biological Sciences at Imperial College London, and I currently work as a Data Analyst Intern at TikTok Shop UK. The role you describe, helping clients work out how to use AI and digital products well and turning that into experiences people actually use, sits right where my interests are.",

 r"What draws me to Konrad is the way strategy, design and technology work together on the same problem. I enjoy taking an unclear business question, understanding what the client really needs, and turning it into something concrete that can be tested, and I like that your strategy team works alongside designers and engineers rather than handing over a slide deck. I also like that the role includes tracking how AI is changing products, because that is the part of the field I most want to learn.",

